   "stem": {
      "text": "The table gives values of the differentiable functions p and q and their derivatives at selected values of x. Let \\( h(x) = p(q(x)) \\). The entry for \\( q'(2) \\) is missing, but \\( h'(2) = -5 \\). Find \\( q'(2) \\).",
