   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = p'(q(x)) \\cdot q'(x) \\). From the table, \\( q(2) = 4 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 4: \\( p'(4) = -1 \\).",
         "rule_named": "chain rule"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "So \\( -5 = h'(2) = \\left(-1\\right) \\cdot q'(2) \\), and \\( q'(2) = 5 \\).",
         "mathjson": 5,
         "rule_named": "solve for the missing factor"
      }
   ],
